								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Sorry if this pisses on your self-importance, but honestly is it REALLY that important to remember who got the second, third, or beyond, epics? (assuming of course that it is important to know who got the first one.)<br /><br />As the great poet Nelly put it. (yes I am being sarcastic here)<br /><br />2 is not a winner...<br />3 no one remembers...<br /><br /> <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/werd.gif" alt="werd" border="0" /><br /><br />
