								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg11897#msg11897">Re: History of Rodcet Nife  [read and add to it]</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #249 on:</b> October 20, 2004, 01:53:40 pm &#187;</span></td>
