							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">And yet, people who do not care about firsts or about stale games still manage to find the time to read a message board about said game, and the find the time to read the posts about said firsts, and then find even more time to post that they don&#039;t care about said firsts in said stale game<br /></div><br />Message Board trolling is a whole different game.&nbsp; EQ is in fact getting repetitive and stale, the only thing keeping it alive is the social aspect of the game which is forever changing. 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
